      "message": "Prove the basic divergence lemmas (#4643)\n\nSmall cleanup in the Navier–Stokes file :) This proves `divergence_add`\nand `divergence_smul` using linearity of `fderiv` and trace. The four\nopen Millennium problem statements are unchanged. `lake build` passes.\n\nCloses #4642",
